CalDAVHideAgendaSystemAuto=Hide automatic system events
CalDAVHideAgendaSystemAutoHelp=When enabled, the native Dolibarr agenda no longer displays events of the “Automatic system” type (e.g. “Other (auto)” and automatic logs such as sending a proposal or invoice by email when those types are enabled). Manually entered events remain visible.
CalDAVAgendaTileColorByUser=Agenda tiles: color by assigned user
CalDAVAgendaTileColorByUserHelp=In the native Dolibarr agenda (month, week, and day views), the color strip to the left of each event uses the color set in the user profile when exactly one user is assigned. When multiple users are assigned, the color below is used. Birthdays, leave, and external iCal events are unchanged.
