# Help messages
CalendarPathHelp=Leave empty to use the default path. Example for Nextcloud: /remote.php/dav/calendars/username/calendarname/. This path is appended to the server URL.
LeaveEmptyToKeepCurrent=Leave empty to keep the current password
CalDAVUrlHttpsHelp=The server address must start with https:// (encrypted connection). HTTP is not accepted. The calendar path is appended to the server address.
CalDAVSslVerify=Verify SSL certificate
CalDAVSslVerifyHelp=Leave set to Yes in production. Set to No only if the server uses a self-signed certificate (less secure: someone on the network could intercept the password).
ErrorCalDAVUrlMustBeHttps=The CalDAV server address must start with https://

