InvalidSyncInterval=The interval must be between 5 and 1440 minutes
ManualSync=Manual synchronization
ManualSyncHelp=Start an immediate synchronization of all active calendars
SyncNow=Synchronize now
SyncSuccess=Synchronization successful
SyncErrors=Synchronization errors
SyncModesExplanation=Synchronization modes explained
SyncModeDolibarrToCalDAVDesc=Events created or modified in Dolibarr are sent to the CalDAV server. Ideal for managing events in Dolibarr and sharing them through CalDAV.
SyncModeCalDAVToDolibarrDesc=Events from the CalDAV server are imported into Dolibarr. Ideal for consolidating external calendars in Dolibarr. Events deleted on CalDAV are also deleted in Dolibarr.
SyncModeBidirectionalDesc=Synchronization in both directions. If an event has changed on both sides since the last successful synchronization, both copies are preserved and a conflict is reported.
